📖 Overview

This project is a Streamlit-based interactive dashboard that visualizes a cardiovascular disease dataset.
It preprocesses the medical data by calculating BMI/Overweight, normalizing cholesterol & glucose values, and converting age into years for better readability.

The app allows users to apply filters (age range, gender) and generates:

    Categorical Plots → Show how lifestyle and health factors (cholesterol, glucose, smoking, alcohol, activity, overweight) relate to cardiovascular disease.
    
    Correlation Heatmap → Displays correlations among medical measurements (blood pressure, height, weight, etc.) to identify strong relationships.

Built with Pandas, NumPy, Seaborn, Matplotlib, and Streamlit, this project makes medical data exploration more intuitive and visual
